@startuml SOP-CHAT-001-Realtime-Project-Chat
autonumber
actor "Member / PM" as User
participant "Next.js Frontend\n(/projects/[id]/chat)" as FE
participant "FastAPI Gateway\n(/ws/chat/{project_id})" as WS
participant "ChatService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(chat_messages)" as DB
queue "Redis Pub/Sub\n(ws:chat:project:{id})" as Redis
participant "redis_listener\n(All Workers)" as Listener

== WebSocket Connect & Handshake ==
User -> FE: Truy cập trang Chat dự án
FE -> WS: Kết nối ws://.../ws/chat/{id}?token=<JWT>
WS -> WS: authenticate_ws(token)
WS -> WS: get_project_context() (Kiểm tra project_members)
WS -> FE: HTTP 101 Switching Protocols (WS Connected)

== Send & Broadcast Message ==
User -> FE: Nhập tin nhắn và gửi
alt WebSocket Connected
    FE -> WS: JSON {type: "message", content: "..."}
    WS -> Service: create_message(project_id, user_id, content)
else Fallback REST
    FE -> Service: POST /api/v1/projects/{id}/messages
end

Service -> DB: INSERT INTO chat_messages
Service -> Redis: publish("ws:chat:project:{id}", payload)
Redis -> Listener: Message event received
Listener -> WS: broadcast_local()
WS -> FE: Gửi tin nhắn real-time tới toàn bộ thành viên đang online
FE -> User: Render tin nhắn mới + Cập nhật Unread badge

@enduml
